Three new guards assert the analytics service's absences: that it contains no write call at all, that it imports nothing from `services/llm.py`, `services/agent.py` or `services/rag.py`, and that every public function takes `user` - keyword-only and without a default for the four that read. `AgentGuardTest` and `RagGuardTest` each carried a copy of the same "every module outside services/, minus the exempt test modules" helper; Phase 5B would have made a third, so it is now shared.
